WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.944 --> 00:00:17.065
stared at the flavor board outside the Sweet Shop.

2
00:00:17.085 --> 00:00:21.769
"Mrs. Sweet erased bubble gum banana swirl!"

3
00:00:21.789 --> 00:00:24.791
"She probably decided that if Mr.

4
00:00:24.831 --> 00:00:28.914
Tate was going to copy her flavor, she didn't want it anymore," said Maggie.

5
00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:32.296
"Or she's trying to hide all traces of her crime!"

6
00:00:32.628 --> 00:00:33.508
chimed in Cole.

7
00:00:34.469 --> 00:00:35.509
"Let's go find Mr.

8
00:00:35.529 --> 00:00:36.830
Tate," Henry said.

9
00:00:40.691 --> 00:00:43.672
When they reached the Dessert Den, the electrician's truck was gone.

10
00:00:44.573 --> 00:00:46.434
The front door was standing open as Mr.

11
00:00:46.474 --> 00:00:49.315
Tate hurried back and forth carrying boxes inside.

12
00:00:49.335 --> 00:00:52.636
"Good, you're back," he said to the kids.

13
00:00:52.656 --> 00:00:54.957
"Grab a box and come on in.

14
00:00:56.858 --> 00:00:57.538
Did you get Mrs.

15
00:00:57.558 --> 00:00:58.318
Sweet to confess?"

16
00:00:58.338 --> 00:01:02.240
"We're still working on the case," Henry said.

17
00:01:03.456 --> 00:01:04.416
"We have a question.

18
00:01:05.217 --> 00:01:08.197
When did you hang up the menu with your secret flavor on it?"

19
00:01:09.378 --> 00:01:10.118
"Right after Mr.

20
00:01:10.158 --> 00:01:11.898
Moss finished painting it on Saturday.

21
00:01:12.178 --> 00:01:13.899
Why?" "Mr.

22
00:01:13.959 --> 00:01:15.039
Moss painted your sign?"

23
00:01:15.339 --> 00:01:16.720
Cole said, surprised.

24
00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:19.240
Mr. Tate nodded.

25
00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:22.301
"At first I thought I'd made a mistake hiring him.

26
00:01:23.501 --> 00:01:24.962
The old guy never stops talking!

27
00:01:25.742 --> 00:01:27.603
But he did a fantastic job on the sign."

28
00:01:27.623 --> 00:01:30.403
"Aha!" Henry smiled.

29
00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:32.744
"I think I know what happened."

30
00:01:33.884 --> 00:01:35.545
Maggie didn't seem to hear Henry.

31
00:01:35.565 --> 00:01:36.845
"But Mr.

32
00:01:36.885 --> 00:01:38.005
Moss is dating Mrs.

33
00:01:38.065 --> 00:01:39.566
Sweet!" she blurted out.

34
00:01:39.586 --> 00:01:41.286
"He is?"

35
00:01:41.846 --> 00:01:42.827
Mr. Tate frowned.

36
00:01:43.827 --> 00:01:44.527
"That proves it!

37
00:01:45.107 --> 00:01:47.508
Mrs. Sweet must have heard about my flavor from him.

38
00:01:48.548 --> 00:01:49.469
I knew she was guilty!"

39
00:01:50.669 --> 00:01:53.390
"Mrs. Sweet isn't guilty," Henry said.

40
00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:55.110
"I knew it!"

41
00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:56.471
Maggie pointed at Mr.

42
00:01:56.511 --> 00:01:59.211
Tate. "You found out about Mrs.

43
00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:00.692
Sweet's new flavor from Mr.

44
00:02:00.752 --> 00:02:04.765
Moss! Then you decided to frame her to drive her out of business!"

45
00:02:06.146 --> 00:02:07.166
"What are you talking about?"

46
00:02:07.407 --> 00:02:08.227
Mr. Tate said.

47
00:02:08.247 --> 00:02:10.968
"Wait," Henry said.

48
00:02:10.988 --> 00:02:12.929
"Maggie, Mr.

49
00:02:13.009 --> 00:02:14.510
Tate isn't guilty either."

50
00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:16.031
"He's not?"

51
00:02:16.311 --> 00:02:16.891
Cole said.

52
00:02:16.911 --> 00:02:18.852
"Then who is guilty?"

53
00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:24.635
"The guilty person is nobody!"

54
00:02:25.735 --> 00:02:26.536
Henry shrugged.

55
00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:32.863
"At least, nobody doing anything wrong on purpose."

56
00:02:32.883 --> 00:02:35.224
"I don't get it."

57
00:02:35.985 --> 00:02:37.406
Maggie was still glaring at Mr.

58
00:02:37.446 --> 00:02:39.928
Tate. But she looked a little less certain.

59
00:02:39.948 --> 00:02:43.471
"Everybody in Belltown knows Mr.

60
00:02:43.511 --> 00:02:45.833
Moss likes to gossip," Henry began.

61
00:02:45.853 --> 00:02:50.437
"I only moved here a month ago, and I already know that," Mr.

62
00:02:50.477 --> 00:02:51.057
Tate agreed.

63
00:02:51.077 --> 00:02:53.279
"Usually Mr.

64
00:02:53.319 --> 00:02:55.921
Moss' gossip is harmless," Henry said.

65
00:02:55.941 --> 00:02:59.024
"He just likes to share interesting news.

66
00:03:00.196 --> 00:03:04.598
I bet he thought your special flavor was interesting, so he mentioned it to Mrs.

67
00:03:04.658 --> 00:03:07.059
Sweet." "Right," Mr.

68
00:03:07.079 --> 00:03:07.619
Tate said.

69
00:03:07.639 --> 00:03:11.061
"And she decided to steal it to ruin my grand opening!"

70
00:03:12.661 --> 00:03:14.442
"Not exactly," Henry said.

71
00:03:14.462 --> 00:03:18.044
"My guess is that he didn't tell her where he'd seen it."

72
00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:20.025
"I get it now!"

73
00:03:20.345 --> 00:03:20.925
Maggie said.

74
00:03:20.945 --> 00:03:26.127
"Mrs. Sweet thought the flavor sounded interesting, so she added it to her menu."

75
00:03:27.188 --> 00:03:27.848
Cole nodded.

76
00:03:28.668 --> 00:03:30.769
"Without realizing that she was stealing Mr.

77
00:03:30.789 --> 00:03:31.570
Tate's flavor!"

78
00:03:33.731 --> 00:03:34.351
He frowned.

79
00:03:34.371 --> 00:03:36.172
"But wait.

80
00:03:37.053 --> 00:03:40.034
If this is just a misunderstanding, why did Mrs.

81
00:03:40.094 --> 00:03:43.236
Sweet behave so suspiciously when we talked to her earlier?"

82
00:03:43.256 --> 00:03:48.218
"Because she didn't want to get her boyfriend in trouble," Henry said.

83
00:03:48.238 --> 00:03:51.800
"That's right," a voice said from the door.

84
00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:54.542
"Mrs. Sweet!"

85
00:03:54.862 --> 00:03:55.542
Maggie cried.

86
00:03:57.143 --> 00:03:58.284
"What are you doing here?"

87
00:03:59.788 --> 00:04:01.550
"I came to apologize to Mr.

88
00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.131
Tate." Mrs.

89
00:04:03.171 --> 00:04:04.372
Sweet stepped toward Mr.

90
00:04:04.392 --> 00:04:08.816
Tate. "I'm sorry for accidentally stealing your flavor.

91
00:04:09.957 --> 00:04:11.778
It took me a little while to find Mr.

92
00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:13.399
Moss and confirm what happened.

93
00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.142
He's sorry too, of course.

94
00:04:17.343 --> 00:04:21.626
He didn't realize that flavor was supposed to be a secret until I told him a few minutes

95
00:04:21.666 --> 00:04:25.089
ago. I took the flavor off our menu right away."

96
00:04:25.109 --> 00:04:26.890
"Oh, I see."

97
00:04:27.431 --> 00:04:28.632
Mr. Tate looked sheepish.

98
00:04:29.728 --> 00:04:31.189
"Thank you for the explanation, Mrs.

99
00:04:31.229 --> 00:04:33.950
Sweet. Maybe I owe you an apology too.

100
00:04:34.631 --> 00:04:36.232
I was ready to believe the worst about you."

101
00:04:36.252 --> 00:04:38.173
"It's all right."

102
00:04:38.573 --> 00:04:39.634
Mrs. Sweet smiled.

103
00:04:39.654 --> 00:04:42.555
"By the way, welcome to Belltown.

104
00:04:43.456 --> 00:04:44.736
I hope we can be friends."

105
00:04:44.756 --> 00:04:47.038
"How can you say that?"

106
00:04:47.298 --> 00:04:48.638
Maggie blurted out in surprise.

107
00:04:48.658 --> 00:04:51.760
"The Dessert Den is your competition!"

108
00:04:52.861 --> 00:04:53.941
Mrs. Sweet chuckled.

109
00:04:53.961 --> 00:04:58.444
"Perhaps. But everyone loves ice cream.

110
00:04:59.536 --> 00:05:01.498
I'm sure there's room for both businesses."

111
00:05:01.518 --> 00:05:04.339
"Of course, we'll be friends," Mr.

112
00:05:04.379 --> 00:05:04.940
Tate said.

113
00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:07.982
"And I hope you'll stop by my grand opening tomorrow.

114
00:05:08.502 --> 00:05:11.584
All of you," he added, looking at the Lemonade Detectives.

115
00:05:11.604 --> 00:05:16.528
"That reminds me—I owe you kids your five-dollar detective fee."

116
00:05:17.609 --> 00:05:19.350
He reached into his pocket for the money.

117
00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:24.213
"Here's another five dollars from me."

118
00:05:25.094 --> 00:05:27.835
Mrs. Sweet took a bill out of her purse and handed it to Henry.

119
00:05:30.852 --> 00:05:34.395
"For clearing my name and for believing in me despite the evidence."

120
00:05:34.415 --> 00:05:40.159
"It was only circumstantial evidence," Maggie said.

121
00:05:41.339 --> 00:05:42.300
Mrs. Sweet laughed.

122
00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:48.564
"In any case, you three are welcome to all the free ice cream you can eat for the

123
00:05:48.604 --> 00:05:49.445
rest of the summer."

124
00:05:49.465 --> 00:05:51.767
"Good idea," Mr.

125
00:05:51.787 --> 00:05:52.547
Tate chimed in.

126
00:05:52.567 --> 00:05:56.670
"You kids are welcome to free dessert here for the rest of the summer as well."

127
00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:58.992
"Wow, thanks!

128
00:06:00.273 --> 00:06:02.703
That's what I call a sweet reward!"

129
00:06:03.406 --> 00:06:04.329
Cole licked his lips.
